      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The consensus strongly leans towards the transition to renewables being inevitable, driven by strong global policy support and declining technology costs for clean energy. While political and economic headwinds always present some level of risk, the fundamental shift in global demand and energy needs is powerful. Therefore, most believe the challenging political \"speculative risk\" is now more of a \"policy execution\" risk rather than a directional one.",
